SUMMARY:Beginner Yoga at the Vineyard
DESCRIPTION:🧘‍♀️ Beginner Yoga at the Vineyard 🌿\nSaturday\, September 5 | 9–10 AM\nTicket Includes: Yoga Class\nStart your Saturday with fresh air\, gentle movement\, and beautiful vineyard views!\nJoin us for a relaxing outdoor yoga class designed for all experience levels\, especially those new to yoga. Our professional instructors will guide you through the fundamentals with gentle stretches\, basic poses\, and mindful movement in a welcoming\, supportive setting.\nSurrounded by our organic vineyard\, wildflowers\, and peaceful morning scenery\, it’s the perfect way to stretch\, breathe\, and ease into your weekend.\nWhat to Bring:\n• Yoga mat\n• Towel\n• Water\nAfter class\, you’re welcome to stick around and enjoy the vineyard during regular open hours. Local cheeses\, salami\, olives\, and light bites are available for purchase\, or bring a picnic to enjoy in our designated picnic area.\nCome stretch\, breathe\, and start your weekend the Great Bear way!
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/beginner-yoga-at-the-vineyard-8/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards (Great Bear)\, 24800 County Rd 101A
CATEGORIES:Fitness,Outside
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/9-5-26-Thumbnail.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
GEO:38.5818013;-121.7499687
