SUMMARY:September Art Spark: Fabric Mosaic
DESCRIPTION:Embrace your creativity at the Manetti Shrem Museum’s Carol and Gerry Parker Art Studio with an afternoon of art making inspired by works on view. \nStop by the studio in September\nSeptember: Fabric Mosaic \nTry out kinusaiga\, a no-sew form of quilting\, to create geometric patterns inspired by Woody De Othello’s ceramic mosaic works. \nNo Art Spark on September 19 during special Orientation programming for UC Davis’ first-year students.
