SUMMARY:Davis Death Cafe
DESCRIPTION:The Monday\, Sept 7 meeting will be held on Zoom\nFirst Mondays of Every Month\n10-11:15am \nEmail Judy Ng at playfold@gmail.com for Zoom login information. \nWe gather to increase awareness of death with the hope of helping people make the most of life. There is no agenda or lecture\, just open\, engaging conversation in a relaxed and supportive setting. Complimentary tea and refreshments provided.\nMeets every first Monday of the month.
